                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Great game... IMHO there are not enough like this out there. this is NOT some point and click escape room.  This is Puzzle mastery.  It will bend your mind into odd ways of thinking. fun times.  that being said....  The only downside for me was the mind numbingly stupid task of having to enter codes over and over to open the same doors.  especially with the amount of back and forth required in this game. some of the puzzles I thought were a bit lazy and were made more difficult than they actually were..  ab ad db cd ca etc puzzle... you'll know when you get there. Let them have your money on this one.  if you like to think instead of just smash. :-)",
